{"unit_id":"Chlyz621__dsh-unstuck#feature-1","repo":"Chlyz621/dsh-unstuck","commit":"08469c30232a52caaf46e2fdf650b138b0788f49","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-unstuck** 的功能「异常轮次续跑」：识别 error、aborted、max-tokens 和 interrupted 等结束原因，在策略允许且没有用户接手时延迟补发继续消息。 由后台事件监测自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:140","lib/core.js:40"]}
{"unit_id":"Chlyz621__dsh-unstuck#feature-2","repo":"Chlyz621/dsh-unstuck","commit":"08469c30232a52caaf46e2fdf650b138b0788f49","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-unstuck** 的功能「假完成识别」：检查已正常结束的轮次是否只有推理无正文、推理与正文重复，或正文尾部残留 DSML 标记；符合条件时按工具调用未送达处理。 由后台事件监测自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:140","lib/core.js:110"]}
{"unit_id":"Chlyz621__dsh-unstuck#feature-3","repo":"Chlyz621/dsh-unstuck","commit":"08469c30232a52caaf46e2fdf650b138b0788f49","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-unstuck** 的功能「请求假死恢复」：监测请求长时间没有流事件，达到配置阈值后处理停滞请求并安排恢复。 由后台事件监测自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:140","lib/index.js:620"]}
{"unit_id":"Chlyz621__dsh-unstuck#feature-4","repo":"Chlyz621/dsh-unstuck","commit":"08469c30232a52caaf46e2fdf650b138b0788f49","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-unstuck** 的功能「等待用户时暂停」：识别正文正在等待确认或选择的情况，阻止自动续跑并记录提醒，避免模型未经回应自行往下做。 由后台事件监测自动触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:140","lib/index.js:140"]}
{"unit_id":"Chlyz621__dsh-unstuck#card-en","repo":"Chlyz621/dsh-unstuck","commit":"08469c30232a52caaf46e2fdf650b138b0788f49","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"**dsh-unstuck** is a background DSH plugin that detects interrupted or stalled turns and likely swallowed tool calls, then resumes eligible work. It pauses when a reply awaits user confirmation and limits repeated recovery. Requires Node.js 22.19 or newer; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:140","lib/core.js:110","cordis.patch.yml:1"]}
